{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Will you put out the eyes of those men?</b> In astonishment: do you suppose you will put out the eyes of Korah and all his assembly? Do they not have eyes to see and to understand this stumbling block — that from the land of Egypt, which is good, you brought us up, and you did not fulfill for us what you stipulated, to bring us into a land flowing with milk and honey; rather you said, 'In this wilderness they shall be consumed, and there they shall die.' Furthermore, you perverted justice against us — and therefore we will not come up to you, for we do not believe you in any matter of discernment regarding this."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:18:16.205939945Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}